[
	# XIME UI, System Overview

	XIME.UI is the component library of the XIME framework for the Elarion ecosystem. It provides a comprehensive suite of glassy, HyperOS-inspired views, layouts, controls, dialogs, menus, drawables, and utilities built on shared blur capture coordination.

	## Activities & Fragments (`xime.ui.activity` / `fragment`)
	Loc: `src/main/java/xime/ui/activity`, `src/main/java/xime/ui/fragment`

	* **Activity.java**, Base activity with edge-to-edge enablement.
	* **SplashActivity.java**, Splash base; subclasses set content after view initialization.
	* **Fragment.java**, Base fragment for XIME surfaces.

	## Base Views (`xime.ui.view`)
	Loc: `src/main/java/xime/ui/view`

	* **View.java**, Foundational base class for all XIME components with AccessibilityEvent and DrawableEvent support.
	* **TextView.java**, Specialized typography system.
	* **EditText.java**, Styled text input.
	* **ImageView.java / PictureView.java**, Image rendering surfaces.
	* **GlassView.java**, Real-time capturing blur surface.
	* **GapView.java**, Pure spacing component.
	* **ChartView.java**, Multi-mode analytics chart widget with 25dp rounded glass border.
	* **ChatView.java**, [SARAH-ACTIVATED] Absolute chat action component.
	* **DailySpinView.java**, Daily spin wheel widget with Crystal 3D glass bevel per sector.
	* **MapView.java / MapTileView.java**, Map surface rendering stitched OpenStreetMap tiles.
	* **OrbitRow.java / OrbitScroller.java**, Orbital row scroller with cached 16ms scroll measurements.

	## Layouts (`xime.ui.layout`)
	Loc: `src/main/java/xime/ui/layout`

	* **Layout.java**, Base layout coordinating shared blur/crystal panel captures across all glass surfaces.
	* **BlurLayout.java**, Glass-blurred container with ThemeManager-aware theme modes.
	* **CardLayout.java**, Glassy card container.
	* **ConstraintLayout.java**, ConstraintSet-based morphing between layout states preserving view identity.
	* **CoordinatorLayout.java**, Centralized interaction coordination.
	* **CycleLayout.java**, High-performance list renderer with forced zero elevation.
	* **FlowLayout.java**, Flowing container with fling-state awareness.
	* **LayerLayout.java**, Depth layering container.
	* **LinearLayout.java / RelativeLayout.java**, Sequential and anchored node layouts.
	* **NestedScrollView.java**, Scrolling container.
	* **OrbitItemLayout.java**, Item container for orbital browsing.
	* **OverlayLayout.java**, Transparent layer for floating content.
	* **PagerLayout.java**, Pager built on SineReflect physics supporting View paging and ViewPager2 adapters.
	* **RecyclerView.java**, Recycling container.
	* **ReflectLayout.java**, Reflection surface layout.
	* **StackLayout.java**, Depth-aware layering container.

	## Bars & Controls (`xime.ui.bar` / `common`)
	Loc: `src/main/java/xime/ui/bar`, `src/main/java/xime/ui/common`

	* **LinearProgressBar.java**, Multi-state progress bar including vertical slider mode.
	* **CircleProgressBar.java**, Circular progress and track bar.
	* **SearchBar.java**, Glassy real-time search interface with keyboard focus handling.
	* **Button.java / IconButton.java / FloatingButton.java**, Interaction components with system haptics disabled.
	* **CheckBox.java**, Squircle checkbox with smooth gradient and vector checkmark path.
	* **Chip.java**, Compact selector pill with end-truncation (marquee unsupported by Material chips).
	* **Dropdown.java**, Premium dark glassmorphic selection menu.
	* **RadioButton.java**, Radio selection group item.
	* **Switch.java**, MIUI-style smooth toggle.
	* **TextField.java**, Text field reading standard and custom Xoeris attributes.

	## Dialogs (`xime.ui.dialog`)
	Loc: `src/main/java/xime/ui/dialog`

	* **Dialog.java**, Standalone panel window with solid 50% opacity theme-aware backdrop.
	* **BottomDialog.java**, [SARAH-ACTIVATED] Ultra-responsive glass-blurred bottom sheet.
	* **EdgeDialog.java**, Side-anchored sliding panel.
	* **PopUpDialog.java**, Glassmorphism bottom notification popup sliding above the navigation bar.
	* **SurfaceDialog.java**, Full-screen layered dialog surface.
	* **DatePickerDialog.java / TimePickerDialog.java**, Dark glassmorphic date and analog/digital time pickers.

	## Menus (`xime.ui.menu`)
	Loc: `src/main/java/xime/ui/menu`

	* **HeaderMenu.java**, Top-bar navigation with collapsed/expanded height-safe layout.
	* **SubHeaderMenu.java**, Secondary navigation with layered search support.
	* **FooterMenu.java**, Bottom navigation with elevator mode and centered add-button protocol.
	* **TitleMenu.java**, [SARAH-ACTIVATED] Simplified header displaying only a centered title.
	* **FloatingMenu.java**, Detached navigation pill with background ring and center anchor.

	## Drawables (`xime.ui.drawable`)
	Loc: `src/main/java/xime/ui/drawable`

	* **AnimatedGradientDrawable.java**, Non-stop animated gradient with angle rotation and HSL morphing.
	* **AccuracyRadiusDrawable.java**, Translucent IP geolocation accuracy circle.
	* **PulsingDotDrawable.java**, Animated glowing dot for precise location.
	* **SpectrumDrawable.java**, Audio spectrum rendering drawable.
	* **SunPathDrawable.java**, Sun path arc with glow and core layers.

	## Events (`xime.ui.event`)
	Loc: `src/main/java/xime/ui/event`

	* **AccessibilityEvent.java / DrawableEvent.java / KeyEvent.java / ParentEvent.java**, Component event contracts.
	* **ReflectParallaxEvent.java / OriginReflectParallaxEvent.java / SourceReflectParallaxEvent.java**, Parallax reflection event family.

	## Utilities (`xime.ui.utils`)
	Loc: `src/main/java/xime/ui/utils`

	* **Window.java**, Fully standalone window operations with zero Dialog references.
	* **Views.java**, Hierarchical traversal and modification helpers.
	* **Kinetics.java**, Physics calculations for motion.
	* **Motion.java**, Common interaction logic helpers.
	* **Elevator.java**, Elevated quick-action component with ring and anchor.
	* **WeatherController.java**, Weather widget state controller with error fallback.
	* **RifeFrameInterpolator.java**, Wraps ncnn-vulkan RIFE-style two-frame + timestep interpolation models.

	## Resources (`res`)
	Loc: `src/main/res`

	* **values/**, attrs.xml, colors.xml (+ values-night), dimens.xml, ids.xml, strings.xml, styles.xml, themes.xml.
	* **layout/**, activity, dialog, player_view, player_bio/lyrics/queue, widget_map/media/weather, search_bar, text_view, media rows, ai_chat_widget, lyrics_widget, splash_activity.
	* **drawable/**, xoeris_* vector icon set covering media, navigation, system toggles, and playback speeds.
	* **anim/ + interpolator/**, xoeris_standard_interpolator, xoeris_spring, xoeris_standard motion definitions.
	* **menu/**, weather_footer_menu.
]
